---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Ruijie Wu — Returning to the living body" description="Psychotherapy, embodied practice, dance movement and writing by Ruijie Wu.">
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-topline">
      <span class="eyebrow">Psychotherapy · Embodiment · Movement</span>
      <span class="hero-index">Independent practice / Notes from a life in motion</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1>Returning<br /><em>to the living</em><br />body<span class="full-stop">.</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">A space for listening to the body, making sense of experience, and discovering new possibilities for being in the world.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}about/`}>Enter this space <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero-photo">
        <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/hero-autumn-movement.webp`} alt="A figure moving beside the sea, fabric caught in the wind" fetchpriority="high" />
        <figcaption><span>01 /</span> Movement · Space · Becoming</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-bottomline">
      <span>Ruijie Wu / 伍芮洁</span>
      <span>Psychotherapy & embodied practice</span>
      <span>China · France · In between</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro-band">
    <div class="container intro-band-grid">
      <span class="eyebrow">A point of departure</span>
      <p class="statement">The body is not simply something we have. It is a way we meet the world, remember, relate, resist, and become.</p>
      <span class="intro-signature">— A thought that keeps unfolding</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container ways-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">Fields of practice</span><h2>Ways of<br /><em>paying attention.</em></h2></div>
      <p>Different paths into experience, held with curiosity, respect and care.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}practice/`}><span class="number">01</span><h3>Psychotherapy</h3><p>Emotional life, relationships, grief, change, identity and questions of meaning.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a>
      <a class="card" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}practice/`}><span class="number">02</span><h3>Embodied approaches</h3><p>Sensation, gesture, movement and the knowledge that emerges through the body.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a>
      <a class="card" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}workshops/`}><span class="number">03</span><h3>Learning together</h3><p>Workshops and teaching where psychology meets movement and creativity.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="image-notes container">
    <div class="image-notes-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">Fragments of attention</span>
      <p>Small scenes, gestures and landscapes that invite us to pause.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="image-notes-grid">
      <figure class="image-note image-note-wide">
        <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/sea-at-dusk.webp`} alt="The sea and a distant figure at dusk" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>02 / At the edge of the day</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="image-note image-note-tall">
        <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/hero-sheer-sky.webp`} alt="A gesture reaching toward the open sky through translucent fabric" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>03 / A gesture toward possibility</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing-note">
    <div class="container closing-grid">
      <span class="eyebrow">An open-ended practice</span>
      <div>
        <p class="statement">Not everything needs to be fixed. Sometimes we need a place where experience can unfold, take shape, and be met differently.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}writing/`}>Read notes & reflections <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
